%!PS
% Test content for process.ps: four steps, the key step last, a path that jumps
% forward from the first step to the last; dusk theme.
% `psanim check process-incident.ps` runs process.ps with it.
/tpl (process.ps) component
/film /tpl << /Params <<
  /look /dusk
  /heading (When the pager goes off)
  /steps [
    [ (alert) (A monitor sees errors rise and pages the on-call engineer.) ]
    [ (triage) (The engineer decides how bad it is and who else to call.) ]
    [ (mitigate) (Traffic moves away from the failing part.) ]
    [ (review) (A written review says what to change so it does not recur.) ]
  ]
  /key 3
  /why (Without the review, the same page comes back next month.)
  /loop [ 0 3 (false alarm) (A false alarm skips straight to tuning the monitor.) ]
  /summary (Stop the damage first; learn from it after.)
>> >> instance
<< /Size [1280 720] /Duration /film componentduration /FPS 30 >> animation
/scene { /film << /After /hold >> place } def
